{
  "id": "cpp_fundamentals__archivos_y_programa_completo__referencias_del_curso",
  "title": "Referencias del curso",
  "pages": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "REFERENCIAS"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Black, P. E. (2020, 9 de noviembre). Algorithm. En P. E. Black (Ed.), Dictionary of algorithms and data structures. National Institute of Standards and Technology. Recuperado el 20 de octubre de 2026, de https://www.nist.gov/dads/HTML/algorithm.html",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Dictionary of algorithms and data structures",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Durstenfeld, R. (1964). Algorithm 235: Random permutation. Communications of the ACM, 7(7), 420. https://doi.org/10.1145/364520.364540",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Communications of the ACM, 7",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Filliben, J. J., & Heckert, N. A. (s. f.). Measures of location. NIST/SEMATECH e-Handbook of Statistical Methods. https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda351.htm",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Measures of location",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "GitHub. (s. f.-a). About the repository README file. GitHub Docs. https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-readmes",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "About the repository README file",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "GitHub. (s. f.-b). Adding a file to a repository. GitHub Docs. https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/working-with-files/managing-files/adding-a-file-to-a-repository",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Adding a file to a repository",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "GitHub. (s. f.-c). Creating a new repository. GitHub Docs. https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/creating-and-managing-repositories/creating-a-new-repository",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Creating a new repository",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "GitHub. (s. f.-d). Creating new files. GitHub Docs. https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/working-with-files/managing-files/creating-new-files",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Creating new files",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "GitHub. (s. f.-e). Downloading source code archives. GitHub Docs. https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/working-with-files/using-files/downloading-source-code-archives",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Downloading source code archives",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "GitHub. (s. f.-f). Ignoring files. GitHub Docs. https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/git-basics/ignoring-files",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Ignoring files",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 22/WG 14. (2023). Programming languages — C (Borrador de trabajo N3096). https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg14/www/docs/n3096.pdf",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Programming languages — C",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Köppe, T., Maurer, J., Perchik, D., & Smith, R. (Eds.). (2023). Working draft, standard for programming language C++ (N4950). ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 22/WG 21. https://www.open-std.org/jtc1/sc22/wg21/docs/papers/2023/n4950.pdf",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Working draft, standard for programming language C++",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2021, 3 de agosto). /Od (Disable (Debug)). Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/reference/od-disable-debug?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "/Od (Disable (Debug))",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2024, 12 de abril). /DebugExe (devenv.exe). Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/ide/reference/debugexe-devenv-exe?view=visualstudio",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "/DebugExe (devenv.exe)",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025a, 23 de agosto). Compiler command-line syntax. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/reference/compiler-command-line-syntax?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Compiler command-line syntax",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025b, 23 de agosto). /Fe (Name EXE File). Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/reference/fe-name-exe-file?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "/Fe (Name EXE File)",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025c, 11 de agosto). Return value of cl.exe. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/reference/return-value-of-cl-exe?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Return value of cl.exe",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025d, 11 de noviembre). Tutorial: Debug C++ code. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/debugger/getting-started-with-the-debugger-cpp?view=visualstudio",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Tutorial: Debug C++ code",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025e, 11 de noviembre). Use command-line parameters to install, update, and manage Visual Studio. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/install/use-command-line-parameters-to-install-visual-studio?view=visualstudio",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Use command-line parameters to install, update, and manage Visual Studio",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025f, 11 de noviembre). Visual Studio Community component directory. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/install/workload-component-id-vs-community?view=visualstudio",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Visual Studio Community component directory",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2025g, 30 de octubre). What is debugging? Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/debugger/what-is-debugging?view=visualstudio",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "What is debugging?",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2026a, 16 de julio). Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/vscpp-step-0-installation?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Install C and C++ support in Visual Studio",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2026b, 1 de abril). Visual Studio 2026 product family system requirements. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/releases/2026/vs-system-requirements",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Visual Studio 2026 product family system requirements",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2026c, 28 de mayo). Walkthrough: Compiling a native C++ program on the command line. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/walkthrough-compiling-a-native-cpp-program-on-the-command-line?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Walkthrough: Compiling a native C++ program on the command line",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2026d, 31 de marzo). Windows SDK. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/apps/windows-sdk/",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Windows SDK",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Microsoft. (2026e, 26 de marzo). /Z7, /Zi, /ZI (Debug Information Format). Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/reference/z7-zi-zi-debug-information-format?view=msvc-170",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "/Z7, /Zi, /ZI (Debug Information Format)",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Stroustrup, B. (2024). Programming: Principles and practice using C++ (3.ª ed.). Addison-Wesley.",
          "emphasis": [
            {
              "text": "Programming: Principles and practice using C++",
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
