              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Microsoft. (2026a, 28 de mayo). Walkthrough: Compiling a native C++ program on the command line. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/build/walkthrough-compiling-a-native-cpp-program-on-the-command-line?view=msvc-170",
