                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Microsoft. (2026b, 31 de marzo). Windows SDK. Microsoft Learn. https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/apps/windows-sdk/",
                "emphasis": [
                  {
                    "text": "Windows SDK",
